<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <Title>EasyReasy.Auth.Client</Title>
    <Authors>Adam Tovatt</Authors>
    <Description>Minimal client only library for EasyReasy.Auth</Description>
    <Copyright>MIT</Copyright>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>BaseIcon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy</RepositoryUrl>
    <VersionPrefix>2.1.0</VersionPrefix>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>A request passed to SendAsync and answered 401 is now sent again after renewal: SendAsync used to resend the same HttpRequestMessage, which .NET refuses, so the retry always threw InvalidOperationException. The retry now sends a copy carrying the headers and options the caller set and the same content object, which is not buffered; a StreamContent over a seekable stream is rewound to where it started, and one over a stream that cannot seek makes the retry throw HttpRequestException, with the consumed stream's InvalidOperationException as InnerException, instead of sending an empty body. The first 401 response is disposed, a 401 after renewal is returned, and GetAsync and PostAsync send through SendAsync with the HttpClient's default HTTP version. Adds AuthorizedHttpClient.IsRefusalStatus, the public refusal rule the client judges sign-in and refresh answers by, and makes HttpStatusText public, the way the client's messages word a status. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/easy-reasy/blob/auth-client-v$(VersionPrefix)/EasyReasy.Auth.Client/README.md#from-200</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\Icons\PNG\Normal\128w\BaseIcon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
